{"4333620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HAKOTOREE", "steam_appid": 4333620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows you to control a &quot;Hakorobo&quot; and enjoy various actions using boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a variety of box-based actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the box and smash it into your opponent. The action is very simple and intuitive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are easy, so even those who aren't good at action games can enjoy the action of &quot;HAKOTOREE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Single Player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are available where you can experience the action of &quot;HAKOTOREE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various box-related actions to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the single-player stages and you'll naturally become accustomed to controlling &quot;Hakorobo.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Online multiplayer will be unlocked once you complete Stage 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Talos Realm&quot; is a realm in the corner of virtual space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its inhabitants, the &quot;Hakorobo,&quot; live happily in eternal time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious computer virus suddenly breaks out, infecting the &quot;Hakorobo&quot; and causing them to lose their sense of self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are about to be sent into the real world as soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By chance, the carefree &quot;Hakorobo&quot; dozes off and avoids infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He sets out to find the &quot;Reset Switch&quot; deep within the world to save the world from crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Online Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;HAKOTOREE&quot; supports online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split into Blue Team and Red Team, players compete to capture boxes and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple yet profound action of using boxes with everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Once you complete all single-player stages, you'll be able to play under Battle Royale rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows you to control a &quot;Hakorobo&quot; and enjoy various actions using boxes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a variety of box-based actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the box and smash it into your opponent. The action is very simple and intuitive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are easy, so even those who aren't good at action games can enjoy the action of &quot;HAKOTOREE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Single Player</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages are available where you can experience the action of &quot;HAKOTOREE&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use various box-related actions to clear the stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the single-player stages and you'll naturally become accustomed to controlling &quot;Hakorobo.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Online multiplayer will be unlocked once you complete Stage 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Talos Realm&quot; is a realm in the corner of virtual space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its inhabitants, the &quot;Hakorobo,&quot; live happily in eternal time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious computer virus suddenly breaks out, infecting the &quot;Hakorobo&quot; and causing them to lose their sense of self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are about to be sent into the real world as soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By chance, the carefree &quot;Hakorobo&quot; dozes off and avoids infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He sets out to find the &quot;Reset Switch&quot; deep within the world to save the world from crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆Online Multiplayer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;HAKOTOREE&quot; supports online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split into Blue Team and Red Team, players compete to capture boxes and score points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the simple yet profound action of using boxes with everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Once you complete all single-player stages, you'll be able to play under Battle Royale rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "This is a game where you control &quot;Hakorobo&quot; and enjoy various actions using boxes. You can experience various actions using boxes, such as grabbing a box and slamming it into your opponent. The actions are very simple. Even people who are not good at action games can enjoy the action of &quot;HAKOTOREE&quot;", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333620/9dbf78fd51c419fa563dfc52ccb3d8fb09b71bee/header.jpg?t=1773359486", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4333620/dc7ee0b6abd3a71ba503e867ed26bce4980e62a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773359486", "capsule_imagev5": "https://share